{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05486","headline":"和张荆州九龄晨出郡舍林下 · 崔颂","name":"和张荆州九龄晨出郡舍林下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"优闲表政清，林薄赏秋成。\n江上悬晓月，往来亏复盈。\n天云抗真意，郡阁晦高名。\n坐啸应无欲，宁辜济物情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}